window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>\"A buffet of all things deliciously dark and naughty.\" (Di, Twisted Book Reviews) </p> <p>My vow of celibacy has never been broken nor tempted, not even when the plague thrust me into a lawless, brutal world. So why did God send the only surviving woman to a priest? To test me? Or to save me? </p> <p>This stand-alone novella can be listened to as an introduction to the Trilogy of Eve or as bonus material between the other books.</p>"; 
